#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1960|month=January|author=G. Freeman Allen|title="Condor"&mdash;British Railways' fastest freight train|journal=Trains Illustrated|page=48|text=From Keighley onwards we had obviously returned to '''civilisation''', for the surrounding country was now studded with the sodium street lights of suburbia and a thickening industrial haze was blotting out the moon.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en-GB|author=David Smith|title=Trump paints himself as great white hope in racism-drenched Davos speech|work=w:The Guardian|date=2026-01-21|url=https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/jan/21/trumps-davos-speech-stephen-miller-white-identity-politics|issn=0261-3077|passage=It is also there in Miller’s worldview, which has long promoted racist fears of demographic replacement of white people and '''civilisation''' decline.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260227052654/https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/jan/21/trumps-davos-speech-stephen-miller-white-identity-politics}}

