===Etymology===
{{blend|en|smoke|fog}}.<ref name="BackgroundOfBlending">{{cite-book|title=Globalistics and Globalization Studies: Global Transformations and Global Future|author=Olga Kornienko, Grinin L, Ilyin I, Herrmann P, Korotayev A|pages=220–225|url=https://hal-hprints.archives-ouvertes.fr/hprints-01794187/document|ISBN=978-5-7057-5026-9|year=2016|location=Volgograd|publisher=Uchitel Publishing House|chapter=Social and Economic Background of Blending|chapterurl=https://www.socionauki.ru/upload/socionauki.ru/book/files/globalistics_and_globalization_studies_5_en/220-225.pdf}}</ref>

