===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|schateren|t=to scatter, dash}}, an assibilated form of {{cog|enm|scateren}} {{gloss|"to scatter"; see {{l|en|scatter}}}}, from {{inh|en|ang|scaterian}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*skat-|t=to smash, scatter}}, perhaps ultimately {{onomatopoeic|en|title=imitative}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|nl|schateren|t=to burst out laughing}}, {{cog|nds|schateren}}, {{cog|sq|shkatërroj|t=to destroy, devastate}}.  {{doublet|en|scatter}}.

