===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|*slammen}} {{q|not recorded}}, apparently from a Scandinavian source ultimately from {{der|en|non|slæma}}, {{m|non|slœma|t=to slam, swing a weapon, strike an object out of reach}}, related to {{cog|non|slamra}}, {{m|non|slambra|t=to slam}}. Cognate with {{cog|nb|slamre|t=to slam}}, {{cog|sv|slamra|t=to pound, beat, make a clatter, rattle}}, {{cog|nn|slamra|t=to sway, dangle}}.

